  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inventory study for clean cooking in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The study effectively entailed a SWOT analysis of the clean cooking sector a) in each of the twelve ECOWAS countries plus Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger) framed in a market development perspective, i.e. seperately focusing on demand, supply and enabling environment of the market for clean cooking.</narrative>
  </description>
